{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are James Anderson, and you\u00a0are going on a journey through the amusement park your missing father built. You will venture into a surreal world inspired by liminal spaces and cosmic elements, from the echoes of an empty maintenance tunnel to the unsettling rustle of the trees surrounding the once lively park.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Atmospheric_Exploration.png?t=1751643853\" /></div>Explore the environment in eerie silence. There is no immersion-breaking combat; the game relies on atmosphere, exploration, and a haunting plot to provide a spookily satisfying horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_exploration.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Twisted_Geometry.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway makes sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_non_euclidian.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Liminal_Elements.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas may seem familiar, but somehow wrong. Never fully real, but never fully fake either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Liminal.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Interactive_Rides.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rides and attractions may seem fun, but\u2026 Nevermind, why spoiling it? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Ride.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570000?t=1751643853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/1d094d0d1c331a6e6e0454bdf84733c838a6bb18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751643853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/6cabd5c5a7eaa74d5e459bd72ea3edc6ae4fe78c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751643853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/6cabd5c5a7eaa74d5e459bd72ea3edc6ae4fe78c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751643853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3777250,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>New Trailer Alert!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More mysteries, more chills. Watch the trailer and wishlist now on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Special_Capsule.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are James Anderson, and you\u00a0are going on a journey through the amusement park your missing father built. You will venture into a surreal world inspired by liminal spaces and cosmic elements, from the echoes of an empty maintenance tunnel to the unsettling rustle of the trees surrounding the once lively park.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Are you ready to get your last ticket and\u00a0step\u00a0inside?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Atmospheric_Exploration.png?t=1751643853\" /></div>Explore the environment in eerie silence. There is no immersion-breaking combat; the game relies on atmosphere, exploration, and a haunting plot to provide a spookily satisfying horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_exploration.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Twisted_Geometry.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway makes sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/gif_non_euclidian.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Liminal_Elements.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some areas may seem familiar, but somehow wrong. Never fully real, but never fully fake either.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Liminal.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/Interactive_Rides.png?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rides and attractions may seem fun, but\u2026 Nevermind, why spoiling it? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/GIF_Ride.gif?t=1751643853\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["X1 Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/70290b0c99fb3b209ad2414e41af625dd02de50d/header.jpg?t=1751643853","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</stron